# 12: a whole operator class.  The card restrict_cls14.dat ships with the model, and this command
# writes it:  python3 validate/make_restriction.py models/dim8_is cls14 cls:14
# Class 14 of the Murphy basis is psi^2 X^2 D: the quark-quark-W-W (and g g, B B, W B) contact
# terms, which enter p p > w+ w- directly (18 diagrams at NP^2==2 for the whole class).  The card
# keeps the 136 coefficients of the class, those of its 57 operators and 79 of their flavour
# structures.  Only the q^2 W^2 D ones matter for this process (all 136 at 1 give the same
# -2.33 pb), and they are switched on here.  The purely bosonic X^2 H^2 D^2 class (cls7) has no
# three-point vertex and gives no diagram for this process; it enters p p > w+ w- z, see the
# triboson study.
import model dim8_is-cls14
generate p p > w+ w- NP^2==2
output runs/12_ww_cls14
launch runs/12_ww_cls14
set nevents 5000
set hel_recycling False
set ebeam1 6800
set ebeam2 6800
set Lam 1000
set c8q2W2Dx1 1.0
set c8q2W2Dx2 1.0
set c8q2W2Dx3 1.0
set c8q2W2Dx4 1.0
done
